      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When you choose a professional Shifting To Mumbai Packers And Movers service, the first thing you’ll encounter is the statutory transit paperwork. Every move must be backed by a GST e‑Way bill, which is generated electronically and confirms that GST has been paid on the transport of goods.</p>
